### Register a second user (useful once Ride/driver testing needs two accounts)
POST {{Mova_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": "Jane",
  "studentSurname": "Doe",
  "studentNumber": "EDUV7654321",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

### Try registering the same student number again (should 409 Conflict)
POST {{Mova_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": "John",
  "studentSurname": "Smith",
  "studentNumber": "EDUV1234567",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

### Login with wrong password (should 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{Mova_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentNumber": "EDUV1234567",
  "password": "WrongPassword"
}

### Get user by id (needs a valid token)
GET {{Mova_HostAddress}}/api/user/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get user by id with NO token (should 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{Mova_HostAddress}}/api/user/1

### Get user that doesn't exist (should 404 Not Found)
GET {{Mova_HostAddress}}/api/user/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send a fresh message with the new shape
POST {{Mova_HostAddress}}/api/rides/1/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I'm waiting near the main entrance."
}

### Confirm it comes back clean
GET {{Mova_HostAddress}}/api/rides/1/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change password
POST {{Mova_HostAddress}}/api/user/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Test1234!",
  "newPassword": "NewPass5678!"
}

### Confirm old password no longer works
POST {{Mova_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentNumber": "EDUV1234567",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

### Confirm new password works
POST {{Mova_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentNumber": "EDUV1234567",
  "password": "NewPass5678!"
}

### Upload profile picture
POST {{Mova_HostAddress}}/api/user/profile-picture
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary123

------Boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test.jpg
------Boundary123--